WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
Every medical breakthrough, every
engineering marvel, and every policy

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.920
decision relies on a single, fragile
assumption that the research behind it is

3
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:15.140
true. Scientific publication serves as the
bedrock of public trust.

4
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.980
For centuries, scientific progress has
depended entirely on an unbroken chain

5
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:24.880
of reliable literature. If one link fails,
the subsequent research built on

6
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.352
top of it fractures. gears.
